535 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(1- Secreted by: parotid, submandibular and sublingual glands; in addition of many small buccal glands.)/Pg 17 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

536 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(2- Amount: About 1500 ml)/Pg 17 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

537 0 obj
