579 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 1402 0 R/E(Antibodies \(immune globulin IgA\) destroy oral pathogenic bacteria,)/Pg 18 0 R/K[22]>>
endobj

580 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 1403 0 R/E(Lactoferrin is a bacteriostatic.)/Pg 18 0 R/K[23]>>
