691 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(I- ACID SECRETION)/Pg 22 0 R/K[15]>>
endobj

692 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 1421 0 R/E(It is an active process, which needs high energy. Acid is secreted by the parietal cells, which are characterised by having large number of mitochondria \(for energy production\) and intracellular canaliculi.)/Pg 22 0 R/K[16]>>
endobj

693 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 1422 0 R/E(Mechanism of Acid Secretion:)/Pg 22 0 R/K[17]>>
endobj

694 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(The following steps occur inside the parietal cells )/Pg 22 0 R/K[18]>>
endobj

695 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 1423 0 R/E(Cl- is actively transported from the cytoplasm of parietal cells to the lumen. This creates negative potential of -40 to -70 mv inside lumen.)/Pg 22 0 R/K[19]>>
endobj

696 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 1424 0 R/E(This leads to passive diffusion of K+ from the cell to the lumen.)/Pg 22 0 R/K[20]>>
endobj

697 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 1425 0 R/E(H2O dissociates into H+ & OH- in the cell cytoplasm.)/Pg 22 0 R/K[21]>>
endobj

698 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 1426 0 R/E(H+ is actively secreted to lumen in exchange for K+ by H+/K+ ATPase pump \(proton pump\). Thus, most of the K+ that had diffused into lumen in step 2 is reabsorbed by the cell and H+ takes their place in the lumen.)/Pg 22 0 R/K[22]>>
endobj

699 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 1427 0 R/E(CO2 \(formed during cell metabolism or entering by blood\) combines with H2O under the effect of carbonic anhydrase enzyme to form carbonic acid.)/Pg 22 0 R/K[23]>>
endobj

700 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 1428 0 R/E(Carbonic acid dissociates into HCO3 and H+)/Pg 22 0 R/K[24]>>
endobj

701 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 1429 0 R/E(HCO diffuses out of the cell to blood in exchange for Cl then step 1 is repeated.)/Pg 22 0 R/K[25]>>
endobj

702 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 1430 0 R/E<FEFF00482082004F00200070006100730073006500730020007400680072006F0075006700680020007400680065002000630065006C006C00200074006F00200074006800650020006C0075006D0065006E0020006200790020006F0073006D006F007300690073002E>/Pg 22 0 R/K[26]>>
endobj

