722 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 1434 0 R/E(Gastrin: it acts either directly on oxyntic cells by increasing intracellular Ca+2 \(like acetylcholine\) or indirectly through stimulating the secretion of histamine from enterochromaffin-like cells \(ECL cells\).)/Pg 23 0 R/K[13]>>
endobj

723 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H5/P 1435 0 R/T(Mechanism of action of HCI stimuli:)/E(Mechanism of action of HCI stimuli:)/Pg 23 0 R/K[14]>>
endobj

724 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 1436 0 R/E(Binding of these stimuli with their receptors in Parietal cells release 2nd messengers which transfer the H+/K+ ATPase proteins from the membranes of intracellular vesicles to the plasma membrane; thus, increasing the number of pump proteins in the plasma membranes)/Pg 23 0 R/K[15]>>
