endobj

806 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 1475 0 R/E(ethanol, vinegar, bile salts, aspirin, corticosteroids, and other nonsteroidal anti-inflammatory drugs. Aspirin and related drugs inhibit prostaglandin synthesis & consequently mucus secretion.)/Pg 26 0 R/K[14]>>
