848 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 1496 0 R/E(Release of a small amount of trypsin into the pancreas during the chain reaction which produces active enzymes could digest the pancreas. Thus, It is important that the proteolytic enzymes of the pancreatic juice are not activated until they reach the intestine.)/Pg 27 0 R/K[27]>>
