1030 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(It is in the form of mucins, forming a blanket of mucus that covers and protects the intestinal epithelium. The mucus blanket lubricates, binds some bacteria and holds immunoglobulins in place so that they can bind to pathogens.)/Pg 34 0 R/K[13]>>
endobj

